        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At the dawn of the interstellar era, humanity and its machine workforce have expanded into a remote stellar neighbourhood. Explore, expand, exploit, and exterminate across the nearby stars in a real-scale, fully-3D environment to overcome your rivals, mastering military power, prosperous governance, booming industry, wealth, resources, and their separate technology trees. Choose your faction and your path to victory, but travel it alone; you’ll find no friends in the hostile and dangerous depths of space.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hard Sci-Fi</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets trace realistic orbits around their stars and fleets take time to reach their targets, moving to where they will be. Journeys between stars take years, so ensure your star systems are well defended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/7bdc663b75ba6803cd5ebc2adcc967cc.poster.avif?t=1772809272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/7bdc663b75ba6803cd5ebc2adcc967cc.webm?t=1772809272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/7bdc663b75ba6803cd5ebc2adcc967cc.mp4?t=1772809272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your faction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many factions have made their way from the 'Cradle Stars' to these new worlds, each shaped by their past and with their own perks and variation of gameplay. Which will you choose to lead to supremacy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/180e76bb41537369499d947808324130.avif?t=1772809272\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your fleet</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build fleets of machine ships and armies, and command them between planets and stars. Whether to explore new worlds, settle them, conquer them from your enemies, or protect your own, your military strategy and tactics will be key to survival and, if strong enough, victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/1b48d1b79cc015e9bd08ee39ae2f1954.poster.avif?t=1772809272\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/1b48d1b79cc015e9bd08ee39ae2f1954.webm?t=1772809272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/1b48d1b79cc015e9bd08ee39ae2f1954.mp4?t=1772809272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your faction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your citizens may live in comfort, but prosperity is never guaranteed. As the architect of their future, you must keep them satisfied and secure. Balance growth and stability as you turn fragile colonies into thriving powerhouses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your industrial might</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a universe where machines have replaced humans as the workforce behind the biggest empires, you must balance creating strong and efficient machines with growing their numbers and expanding to new planets and systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create a thriving economy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wealth is the lifeblood of any powerful empire, and managing it is crucial to your survival. Maintain a delicate balance of income and expenditure to ensure your empire remains strong, whilst not crumbling under its own weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/14bf45d1630da99e92f54976c91f09e7.avif?t=1772809272\" width=1009 height=690 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Achieve technical mastery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your faction will advance simultaneously through six distinct tech trees, each helping you move closer to interstellar dominance. From military innovations to industrial breakthroughs, each tree offers tools for success in different areas of empire-building. As you progress, you’ll need to strategically prioritize and balance your research to create synergies between the trees. Mastering the tech trees isn't just about unlocking new technologies, it's about finding the most effective routes to victory, whether through military conquest, economic prosperity, or industrial supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/3ac90b0ad1668d82e8147f9be3c37cd9.avif?t=1772809272\" width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harness and exploit resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Stellar Reach</i>, you will discover 13 unique resources that are scattered across the galaxy, each playing a crucial role in enhancing the effectiveness of your fleets, armies and industries. Scan planets to discover when resources lie within, and expand your territory to harness them. Control of these vital resources could be the key to your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide your conquest among the stars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stellar Reach</i> offers three distinct paths to victory, each with its own challenges and strategic opportunities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest: Dominate rivals through your relentless military might. Build powerful fleets, crush opponents and capture critical systems. Only the strongest will survive the worn-torn stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prosperity: Focus on the well-being of your citizens by transforming a fragile colony into a bustling centre for culture and politics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industry: Harness the full potential of your industrial might. Develop advanced technologies and infrastructure to create an unstoppable empire of machines. Through superior production, rise to supremacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path to victory and adapt to the actions of your rivals!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At the dawn of the interstellar era, humanity and its machine workforce have expanded into a remote stellar neighbourhood. Explore, expand, exploit, and exterminate across the nearby stars in a real-scale, fully-3D environment to overcome your rivals, mastering military power, prosperous governance, booming industry, wealth, resources, and their separate technology trees. Choose your faction and your path to victory, but travel it alone; you’ll find no friends in the hostile and dangerous depths of space.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hard Sci-Fi</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets trace realistic orbits around their stars and fleets take time to reach their targets, moving to where they will be. Journeys between stars take years, so ensure your star systems are well defended.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/7bdc663b75ba6803cd5ebc2adcc967cc.poster.avif?t=1772809272\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/7bdc663b75ba6803cd5ebc2adcc967cc.webm?t=1772809272\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/7bdc663b75ba6803cd5ebc2adcc967cc.mp4?t=1772809272\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam