 13 unique resources that are scattered across the galaxy, each playing a crucial role in enhancing the effectiveness of your fleets, armies and industries. Scan planets to discover when resources lie within, and expand your territory to harness them. Control of these vital resources could be the key to your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578670/extras/29b72184b5661a02a69592649d99ee88.webp?t=1772809272\" width=616 height=3 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide your conquest among the stars</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stellar Reach</i> offers three distinct paths to victory, each with its own challenges and strategic opportunities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquest: Dominate rivals through your relentless military might. Build powerful fleets, crush opponents and capture critical systems. Only the strongest will survive the worn-torn stars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prosperity: Focus on the well-being of your citizens by transforming a fragile colony into a bustling centre for culture and politics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industry: Harness the full potential of your industrial might. Develop advanced technologies and infrastructure to create an unstoppable empire of machines. Through superior production, rise to supremacy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path to victory and adapt to the actions of your rivals!</p>",
